title: Toaster
---
<<declare $toastInToaster = false>>
<<declare $numberOfToast = 0>>
<<if $toastInToaster>>
 You: Do I want to grab the toast?
 -> Yes
  <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Ouchie">>
  You: Ouch it burns!
  <<take_toast ToasterApartment>>
  <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Pickup">>
  You: I got toast.
  <<set $toastInToaster = false>>
  <<set $numberOfToast +=1>>
 -> No
<<else>>
You: Do I want to make some toast?
 ->Yes
  <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Toaster">>
  <<toast ToasterApartment>>
  <<set $toastInToaster = true>>
 ->No
  You: I don't think I'm hungry right now.
<<endif>>
===
